WINDERMERE Miss Lily Hanbury .", "para": 3, "sent": 7, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "THE DUCHESS OF BERWICK Miss Fanny Coleman .", "para": 3, "sent": 8, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "LADY AGATHA CARLISLE Miss Laura Graves .", "para": 3, "sent": 9, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "LADY PLYMDALE Miss Granville .", "para": 3, "sent": 10, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "LADY JEDBURGH Miss B. Page .", "para": 3, "sent": 11, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "LADY STUTFIELD Miss Madge Girdlestone .", "para": 3, "sent": 12, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "MRS. COWPER-COWPER Miss A. de Winton .", "para": 3, "sent": 13, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "MRS. ERLYNNE Miss Marion Terry .", "para": 3, "sent": 14, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "ROSALIE ( Maid ) Miss Winifred Dolan .", "para": 3, "sent": 15, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Morning-room of Lord Windermere\u2019s house in Carlton House Terrace .", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Doors C. and R. Bureau with books and papers R. Sofa with small tea-table L. Window opening on to terrace L. Table R.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "LADY WINDERMERE is at table R. , arranging roses in a blue bowl .", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Enter PARKER.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is your ladyship at home this afternoon?", "name": "PARKER", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes\u2014who has called?", "name": "LADY WINDERMERE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Lord Darlington, my lady.", "name": "PARKER", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Hesitates for a moment .", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Show him up\u2014and I\u2019m at home to any one who calls.", "name": "LADY WINDERMERE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes, my lady.", "name": "PARKER", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Exit C.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It\u2019s best for me to see him before to-night. I\u2019m glad he\u2019s come.", "name": "LADY WINDERMERE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Enter PARKER C.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Lord Darlington,", "name": "PARKER", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Enter LORD DARLINGTON C.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Exit PARKER.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "How do you do, Lady Windermere?", "name": "LORD DARLINGTON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "How do you do, Lord Darlington? No, I can\u2019t shake hands with you. My hands are all wet with these roses. Aren\u2019t they lovely? They came up from Selby this morning.", "name": "LADY WINDERMERE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They are quite perfect.", "name": "LORD DARLINGTON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Sees a fan lying on the table .", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And what a wonderful fan! May I look at it?", "name": "LORD DARLINGTON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Do. Pretty, isn\u2019t it! It\u2019s got my name on it, and everything. I have only just seen it myself. It\u2019s my husband\u2019s birthday present to me. You know to-day is my birthday?", "name": "LADY WINDERMERE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No? Is it really?", "name": "LORD DARLINGTON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes, I\u2019m of age to-day. Quite an important day in my life, isn\u2019t it? That is why I am giving this party to-night. Do sit down.", "name": "LADY WINDERMERE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Still arranging flowers .", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Sitting down .", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I wish I had known it was your birthday, Lady Windermere. I would have covered the whole street in front of your house with flowers for you to walk on. They are made for you.", "name": "LORD DARLINGTON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "A short pause .", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Lord Darlington, you annoyed me last night at the Foreign Office. I am afraid you are going to annoy me again.", "name": "LADY WINDERMERE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I, Lady Windermere?", "name": "LORD DARLINGTON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Enter PARKER and FOOTMAN C. , with tray and tea things .", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Put it there, Parker. That will do.", "name": "LADY WINDERMERE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Wipes her hands with her pocket-handkerchief , goes to tea-table , and sits down .", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Won\u2019t you come over, Lord Darlington?", "name": "LADY WINDERMERE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Exit PARKER C.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Takes chair and goes across L.C.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I am quite miserable, Lady Windermere. You must tell me what I did.", "name": "LORD DARLINGTON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Sits down at table L.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Well, you kept paying me elaborate compliments the whole evening.", "name": "LADY WINDERMERE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Smiling .", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ah, nowadays we are all of us so hard up, that the only pleasant things to pay are compliments. They\u2019re the only things we can pay.", "name": "LORD DARLINGTON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Shaking her head .", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}